# --- Logs (committed selectively) ---
# run_log.csv and validation_log.txt ARE tracked (they grow incrementally)
# Temp logs are not
*.tmp

# NOTE: data/jobs.db IS intentionally tracked.
# It grows incrementally each weekly run and enables Power BI live connection.
# Tradeoff acknowledged: binary diffs bloat history. Acceptable at portfolio scale.
# Production alternative: git-lfs or reconstruct from exported CSVs.
